WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.651
A small change can hide a decision
about how it should behave.

2
00:00:04.651 --> 00:00:07.120
Plan mode gives you time to make it.

3
00:00:08.133 --> 00:00:11.626
You ask for a flag that prints
a greeting in capitals.

4
00:00:11.626 --> 00:00:14.019
The agent can read the project first.

5
00:00:14.019 --> 00:00:17.511
When it comes to a choice
about the flag, it asks you.

6
00:00:17.511 --> 00:00:21.715
Then you can read the planned
changes and the checks it will run.

7
00:00:21.715 --> 00:00:25.013
Approve that plan, and the
agent can start editing.

8
00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:32.811
Use the review to settle the
behaviour and how you'll check it.

9
00:00:32.811 --> 00:00:35.040
Then let the agent make the change.
